title: QriusAI Nonprofit Agent Harness
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mohanty
    given-names: Sanmaya
    affiliation: QriusAI Foundation
  - name: QriusAI Foundation
    website: "https://qriusai.org/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/QriusAI-Foundation/nonprofit-agent-harness"
url: "https://qriusai.org/"
abstract: >-
  An open agent harness for the nonprofit sector. It provides the machinery around an
  agent rather than the agent itself: a human review gate, verification that cited
  claims appear in their sources, per-run budget ceilings, an AI-readiness scoring
  engine, document extraction, pluggable model providers and storage, and an HTTP API.
  Built on Google's Agent Development Kit and usable without it.
keywords:
  - agents
  - nonprofit
  - large language models
  - human in the loop
  - AI readiness
